1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,610
It's been a while,

25
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:55,450
Brother Ceng Niu is still as graceful as before.

26
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:55,730
Mo Zhi
Envoy of the Cultivation Alliance

27
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:58,970
Brother Mo Zhi.

28
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,130
Yes, it's me.

29
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,890
You, step back.

30
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,730
I have a question,

31
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:09,170
I hope Brother Ceng Niu can answer it.

32
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,690
Why did you

33
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:14,650
refuse to become the next Suzaku ?

34
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,130
So that's how it is...

35
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:20,570
It's not that the Cultivation Planet Crystal chose me

36
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,730
but rather...

37
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:24,290
he chose me.

38
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,810
My ambitions

39
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:28,170
are higher than planet Suzaku.

40
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,890
It's a shame...

41
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:34,090
Since Brother Ceng Niu made up his mind,

42
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,770
then I will not try to persuade you.

43
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,090
Repair.

44
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,490
This is the Cultivation Planet Heart.

45
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,730
The one who obtains it,

46
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,130
becomes the next Suzaku.

47
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,130
The Cultivation Planet Heart...

48
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,530
But my cultivation is too low...

49
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:08,010
The one who obtains it can directly become the Suzaku ?

50
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,010
Middle stage Soul Transformation ?

51
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:15,970
How did her cultivation increase so drastically ?

52
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,130
No...

53
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,810
This aura...

54
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,050
It's Qian Feng !

55
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,410
A cultivation furnace

56
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:25,850
that was able to reverse her fate ?

57
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,970
How rare...

58
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:31,210
Azure Dragon bloodline,

59
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,290
you are also a qualified candidate.

60
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:34,730
Unfortunately,

61
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,290
you are not Soul Transformation

62
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:39,050
so you won't be respected.

63
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,410
In that case,

64
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,970
the next Suzaku shall be...

65
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,370
Brother Mo, wait a minute.

66
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:53,290
Although he hasn’t reached Soul Transformation,

67
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,050
that doesn’t mean he never will.

68
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:57,530
Wang Lin,

69
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,090
what do you mean by that ?

70
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,050
What does Brother Mo think ?

71
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,690
Wang Lin !

72
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,890
Your Billion-Soul Flag is useless now

73
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,770
and you are just Early stage Soul Transformation.

74
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,410
If I want to kill you,

75
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,250
it would be as easy as waving my hand !

76
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,610
And if I agree to become the next Suzaku ?

77
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,610
You !

78
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,810
Brother Ceng Niu, have you...

79
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,250
changed your mind ?

80
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:32,170
Do you really need to ask ?

81
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:34,010
Even if I become the Suzaku,

82
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,930
I would just pass the title

83
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,090
to him.

84
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,850
Interesting...

85
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,930
Interesting...

86
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,570
In that case,

87
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,250
from now on,

88
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:50,930
you are the 15th generation Suzaku.

89
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,930
I hope you will cultivate diligently here,

90
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,890
and properly comprehend the Suzaku Seal.

91
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,170
Forsaken Immortal Clan,

92
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:42,010
I can give you a third of planet Suzaku.

93
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,930
But every thousand years,

94
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:47,410
you must deliver at least a 9-Leaf's skull.

95
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,050
Yunque Zi,

96
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,050
do you agree ?

97
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,730
It's decided.

98
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,450
Thank you.

99
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,290
It's nothing,

100
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,730
you don't need to thank me.

101
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,410
Brother Ceng Niu,

102
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:19,490
I may need your help in the future.

103
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:22,610
I hope you will not refuse then.

104
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,530
Naturally.

105
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:27,450
I must now return to the Cultivation Alliance to report,

106
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,290
would Brother Ceng Niu like to leave with me ?

107
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:34,050
I still have some matters to deal with.

108
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:37,250
Use your celestial spiritual energy in this seal

109
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,530
and you can leave.

110
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,530
Brother Ceng Niu,

111
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,690
the path of immortality is long.

112
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,170
I hope that

113
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,890
we will meet again.

114
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:58,770
I have obtained both my and Wan'er's soul strand.

115
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,770
No one can control our lives anymore.

116
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,810
The Billion-Soul Flag is greatly weakened.

117
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,330
After I leave,

118
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,370
I need to find enough souls to repair it.

119
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,410
The next Suzaku is Zhou Wutai.

120
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,690
He is a grateful and righteous man.

121
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,730
Even if I leave,

122
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:18,810
he will take good care of my acquaintances.

123
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,850
That means

124
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:23,930
I no longer need to worry about them.

125
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,930
Xu Liguo.

126
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,050
Master,

127
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:36,410
I have tamed this half-moon blade.

128
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:38,130
It's very obedient.

129
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:40,130
This half-moon blade is pretty mysterious.

130
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,050
I'm sure it will be useful.

131
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:43,180
Number Four,

132
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,570
come and greet Master.

133
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,130
Greetings,

134
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:54,930
Master...?

135
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,970
This half-moon blade is hard to tame,

136
00:07:57,680 --> 00:08:00,010
I can't even imprint my Divine Sense on it.

137
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:02,970
But somehow, it really likes Xu Liguo...

138
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,890
Alright,

139
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,570
as long as I can control it indirectly

140
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,050
and make it serve me.

141
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,610
Number Four, let's go !

142
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:28,810
1 year later

143
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,330
Falling from the night sky

144
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,690
and melting into dust

145
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:42,050
like water without a source.

146
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,770
Like the difference between clouds and mud,

147
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,250
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

148
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:52,410
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls.

149
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:57,010
And like many other unseparable things.

150
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:59,650
In this lifetime,

151
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:02,090
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

152
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:09,850
Old grudges had to be settled

153
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,850
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

154
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:15,890
Use the most vivid love and hate

155
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:15,890
to ask questions to your fate.

156
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:20,290
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

157
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:24,010
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

158
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,450
Only when you bend

159
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:29,470
can you understand the hidden edge of the blade.

160
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,890
The human mind is nature,

161
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:34,010
the rain fell silently like an answer.

162
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,730
Life and death are just moments away,

163
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:38,250
there are many other solutions to grudges.

164
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:43,440
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

165
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:47,730
One stroke is for killing.

166
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:47,730
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

167
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:51,730
One stroke is for caring.

168
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:51,730
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

169
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:56,410
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

170
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:03,610
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers
while prosperity sprouts in summer.

171
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:10,050
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,
the law of cause and effect.

172
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:16,490
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth
so I can get rid of evil.

173
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:24,090
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.
Reincarnation is not to be feared.

174
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,210
Over the past year,

175
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:52,250
the Forsaken Immortal Clan retreated to the northwest of planet Suzaku.

176
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:55,450
From now on, they will no longer bother the cultivators.

177
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,890
After this war,

178
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:04,090
more than half of planet Suzaku's cultivators died.

179
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:06,450
Most sects and countries are severely weakened.

180
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,970
The Forsaken Immortal Clan retreated,

181
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:10,330
we have driven them away !

182
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,010
This is great, we won !

183
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:15,250
Zhou Wutai knew that he needed to be respected.

184
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:17,370
So right after leaving the Suzaku Tomb,

185
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,330
he went into seclusion on Mount Suzaku.

186
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,330
As for Zi Xin and Liu Mei,

187
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,810
I heard that both of them flew into the starry sky.

188
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:30,160
I wanted to recover the 4th primary soul that Zhuque Zi stole,

189
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,170
but I wasn't able to find it.

190
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,530
Little Ru'er is luckier than me.

191
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,850
At least she has a home to return to

192
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,770
and a chance to live with her parents.

193
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:50,650
If Little Ru'er ever cultivates to Nascent Soul,

194
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:54,770
Tie Yan will give this to her.

195
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,970
Before leaving,

196
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:02,130
I went to the old country of Xue Yue.

197
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,890
Even in this bitter cold,

198
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,970
I still found

199
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:10,050
flowers blooming.

200
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,890
Finally,

201
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,490
I returned to the place where I was born.

202
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:41,530
My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.

203
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:42,330
Tie Zhu, you really look like an Immortal now.

204
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,410
You can always come back.

205
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,410
Noooo !!!

206
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,210
Father...

207
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:53,970
Mother...

208
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:58,450
Your son is going to leave…

209
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:33,730
Country of Zhou
Rank 4 cultivation country

210
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,170
Keep playing music !

211
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:38,850
Keep dancing !

212
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,890
Your Highness,

213
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:42,090
let me dance another song for you.

214
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:43,250
Situ,

215
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,850
it's time to go.

216
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,890
That was too quick...

217
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,850
Little Lin,

218
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:53,210
do you want to know why I cultivate ?

219
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,290
Let me tell you,

220
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:58,250
I cultivate because I want all treasures and women

221
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,290
of this world to be mine !

222
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:03,130
If I didn't keep running into strong enemies,

223
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,810
that forced me to cultivate to beat them,

224
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,250
I would have quit

225
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:08,490
cultivating long ago !

226
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:13,850
Situ,

227
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:16,650
your Dao and mine are different.

228
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,130
Let's go.

229
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:25,050
Let's make our own cultivation country.

230
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,210
Fool...

231
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,730
This is the cloud barrier.

232
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,250
After we cross it,

233
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:45,010
we will have left planet Suzaku.

234
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,800
Original body,

235
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,570
come !

236
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:09,330
Good !

237
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:12,250
Like this, you are Peak Middle stage Soul Transformation !

238
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:23,370
Disperse for me !

239
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,970
Brother Wang,

240
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,570
have a safe journey.

241
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:46,610
The younger generations will always surpass us...

242
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:54,810
Uncle ?

243
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:58,930
Goodbye, Ancestor !

244
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,650
Not bad,

245
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,730
at this speed

246
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,570
we will reach

247
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,130
the trade planet in a month.

248
00:14:11,110 --> 00:14:12,130
Right,

249
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,170
I almost forgot this.

250
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,650
While you were gone,

251
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:17,770
I took a stroll around Forsaken Immortal Clan

252
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:20,210
and picked up a bunch of these things.

253
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:21,850
It's for you, take them.

254
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,250
Thank you.

255
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:26,410
You're going to planet Tian Yun, right ?

256
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:27,690
You must get ready.

257
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,650
After watching you fight,

258
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,770
I think you rely too much on artifacts.

259
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,770
Your spells aren't that good...

260
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,130
Since that's the case,

261
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,810
I will teach you 3 spells !

262
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:42,130
I created these 3 spells

263
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:45,770
with my insights after thousands of years of cultivation.

264
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,570
Their power is unmatched.

265
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,770
Wang Lin,

266
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:51,570
you're the only person I will ever pass these to !

267
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,130
Death Finger !

268
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,650
Demonic Finger !

269
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,410
These are...

270
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,890
demonic flames ?

271
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,250
This is the final move...

272
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,410
Little Lin,

273
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:38,610
watch closely !

274
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,410
Underworld Finger !

275
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:01,530
Let's go,

276
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,930
spar with me.

277
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,450
Let me see how much you've learned !

278
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:13,650
1 month later

279
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,530
Not bad, not bad.

280
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,810
I don't need to worry about you now.

281
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:23,610
If you want to know something else,

282
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,770
ask me now.

283
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:26,850
Situ,

284
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,730
what is there

285
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,890
after Ascendant ?

286
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:31,930
Cultivators embarking on the path of immortality

287
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:34,450
all believe that cultivation begins with Qi Condensation

288
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,610
and ends with Ascendant.

289
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,170
But they don't realize

290
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:40,770
that this is merely the first step.

291
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,770
Above this...

292
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,250
there is a second step.

293
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:46,890
The second step ?

294
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,530
Exactly !

295
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:51,970
Ye Wuyou and I obtained this information from the Cultivation Alliance back then.

296
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:53,050
The second step

297
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:55,490
is called the 3 realms of Nirvana Shattering:

298
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,690
Nirvana Scryer,

299
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,650
Nirvana Cleanser,

300
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,410
and finally Nirvana Shatterer.

301
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:02,530
These realms

302
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,770
are the path beyond Ascendant.

303
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,970
Is your cultivation

304
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,370
Nirvana Scryer ?

305
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,290
It's not that easy.

306
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:12,370
Before the second step,

307
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:14,210
there are still two trials:

308
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:16,090
Illusory Yin an Corporeal Yang.

309
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,250
A cultivator's domain

310
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:19,530
will be tempered by the Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang stages.

311
00:17:19,320 --> 00:17:22,250
Only then will you be able to enter Nirvana Scryer.

312
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:26,890
We've arrived.

313
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:29,250
No matter what materials you need,

314
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,890
this trade planet

315
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,330
will definitely have them !

316
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:32,450
Trade Planet
Alliance Star System

317
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:35,130
Little Lin,

318
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:36,650
I'm going ahead

319
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,930
to plunder to my heart's content !

320
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,890
You can look around by yourself,

321
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,730
let's meet in 3 days.

322
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:50,130
I hope that this trade planet

323
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:53,050
has materials to refine my Star Compass.

324
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:58,450
Ming Mei City
Trade Planet

325
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,370
Feel free to pick whatever you like.

326
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:04,490
I thought it would take more effort

327
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:06,370
to buy this Void Wood Stone.

328
00:18:04,390 --> 00:18:07,520
Void Wood Stone

329
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,730
This trade planet is pretty convenient.

330
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,690
I just need some Snow Ink,

331
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:15,330
but I can't find it anywhere.

332
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:20,730
Shang clan’s shop

333
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:20,570
I heard this Shang clan's shop claims to have everything.

334
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,530
Maybe they have some...

335
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,330
Stop right here !

336
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:34,210
You !

337
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,210
This is a place for nobles.

338
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,930
Who the hell are you ?

339
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,050
Get out of here !

340
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,370
A fight started !

341
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,010
Such fast attacks,

342
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:49,930
look !

343
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:56,050
Young Master, save me !

344
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,330
Stop.

345
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,410
Star Rotation !

346
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:07,960
Note: this is another spell Situ Nan taught that wasn't shown.

347
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:12,410
You actually ruined my cultivation foundation !

348
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:19,850
Bai Wei
Heavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple
Middle stage Soul Transformation

349
00:19:17,040 --> 00:19:18,650
It's already over...

350
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,810
Impressive spell, Brother.

351
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,570
May I know what your name is ?

352
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:24,690
Wang Lin.

353
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:26,570
Wang Lin...

354
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:28,850
I am Bai Wei.

355
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,770
Young Master,

356
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:31,410
kill him !

357
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:33,490
Brother Wang,

358
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:35,610
my servant was rude.

359
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:37,130
Please don't be offended.

360
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:38,970
I am from planet Tian Yun,

361
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:40,970
a disciple of the Heavenly Fate Sect.

362
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:43,530
May I ask where Brother Wang is from ?

363
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:46,130
I'm a rogue cultivator

364
00:19:46,040 --> 00:19:47,450
without a sect or planet.

365
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:53,610
Since Brother Wang is unwilling to speak,

366
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:55,730
then I will not inquire any further.

367
00:19:56,800 --> 00:20:00,290
My master celebrates his birthday every 10 000 years and it's very soon.

368
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:01,530
If Brother Wang has time,

369
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,690
please come to planet Tian Yun

370
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:06,810
and allow me to be your host.

371
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,090
Young master, have a look.

372
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,770
So expensive !

373
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,530
Snow Ink

374
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,450
In Ming Mei City

375
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:25,810
at the Shang clan's shop,

376
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:26,890
I want the Snow Ink.

377
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:28,090
Stop running !

378
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:29,530
Stop this !

379
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:35,650
Come on, come on !

380
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,850
Thief, return my Snow Ink !

381
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,250
I'm not some young lady,

382
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:43,210
why are you idiots chasing after me ?

383
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:45,130
You're not getting away !

384
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:54,850
Here, Snow Ink.

385
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:57,490
Little Lin...

386
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:02,010
I'm leaving.

387
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:08,050
You can finally live like a king.

388
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:09,570
I'm sure we'll meet again...

389
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,570
That's right !

390
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:16,290
I'm going to enjoy the rest of my life

391
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:18,210
to the fullest.

392
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:29,650
A celestial artifact !?

393
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:32,330
And it's infinitely close to middle grade ?

394
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:36,770
Kid, how did you obtain so many treasures ?

395
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,250
This is...

396
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:46,650
the method to control this celestial artifact ?

397
00:21:49,320 --> 00:21:50,410
Little Lin,

398
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:52,770
are you giving me this God Slaying Chariot ?

399
00:21:58,080 --> 00:21:59,050
What ?

400
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:00,770
You don't want it ?

401
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:03,010
Who said I didn't want it !?

402
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:11,450
Wang Lin,

403
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:13,810
planet Tian Yun is filled with strangers,

404
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:15,010
be careful.

405
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:19,290
However, you can’t forget your pride as a cultivator of planet Suzaku.

406
00:22:19,280 --> 00:22:20,970
If you have any problems,

407
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:22,770
come find me on planet Feng Luan.

408
00:22:23,320 --> 00:22:24,930
With this old man around,

409
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:26,650
no one will dare to mess with you !

410
00:22:28,600 --> 00:22:30,130
Don't get ahead of yourself.

411
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,250
If you ever get your ass kicked,

412
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:34,250
come find me on planet Tian Yun.

413
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:36,530
With me around,

414
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:38,250
no one will dare to touch you !

415
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:40,690
Keep that mentality !

416
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,290
Fine,

417
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:45,050
if I'm ever in trouble,

418
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,930
I'll come and find you.

419
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:49,330
You better make a name for yourself !

420
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,970
Because I'll be ashamed

421
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:52,610
if you don't.

422
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:02,450
Wang Lin,

423
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,410
take care.

424
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:10,770
I wonder if

425
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:13,930
we will have another chance to meet.

426
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:16,530
Situ,

427
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:18,210
take care.

428
00:23:19,520 --> 00:23:21,530
I, Wang Lin, have never in my life

429
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:24,240
bowed to the heavens or the earth.

430
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:26,490
I pay respects to neither ghosts or gods.

431
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:28,330
I only bow to my parents

432
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,210
and pay respects to Situ...

433
00:23:45,910 --> 00:26:22,320
There is an after credits scene.

434
00:24:03,030 --> 00:24:06,580
To let go of the consequences of my actions

435
00:24:06,330 --> 00:24:08,300
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

436
00:24:08,090 --> 00:24:10,240
like scattered ink.

437
00:24:10,870 --> 00:24:17,720
As destiny falls

438
00:24:13,710 --> 00:24:17,720
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

439
00:24:17,470 --> 00:24:25,320
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

440
00:24:20,710 --> 00:24:25,320
wither and melt into rivers.

441
00:24:25,510 --> 00:24:32,880
Who can deceive

442
00:24:28,270 --> 00:24:32,880
the law of the heavens ?

443
00:24:32,950 --> 00:24:36,200
Countless generations

444
00:24:34,230 --> 00:24:36,200
have tried before me.

445
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:39,920
But how could I not catch my dreams

446
00:24:38,070 --> 00:24:39,920
within my warm fingers ?

447
00:24:40,230 --> 00:24:44,000
You're at my side when I'm alone

448
00:24:43,750 --> 00:24:47,320
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

449
00:24:47,830 --> 00:24:51,280
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

450
00:24:51,390 --> 00:24:55,480
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

451
00:24:53,230 --> 00:24:55,480
in the streets.

452
00:24:55,390 --> 00:25:00,440
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

453
00:24:56,950 --> 00:25:00,440
Can I break the rules ?

454
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:03,160
To run towards you !

455
00:25:02,950 --> 00:25:06,480
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

456
00:25:06,230 --> 00:25:11,120
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

457
00:25:10,870 --> 00:25:14,520
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

458
00:25:14,310 --> 00:25:19,200
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

459
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:24,880
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

460
00:25:24,750 --> 00:25:28,800
If your soul is willing to wander,

461
00:25:28,550 --> 00:25:33,440
can I still take your hands

462
00:25:30,230 --> 00:25:33,440
and hold them tight ?

463
00:25:33,350 --> 00:25:36,520
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

464
00:25:36,270 --> 00:25:41,400
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

465
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:44,680
I dream of destroying

466
00:25:44,590 --> 00:25:49,400
the shackles of our fate.

467
00:25:49,150 --> 00:25:53,360
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

468
00:25:53,110 --> 00:25:56,160
You're the hardest to let go of.

469
00:25:55,990 --> 00:26:00,040
I want to be with you again

470
00:25:59,870 --> 00:26:03,400
so I can look in your eyes.

471
00:26:03,430 --> 00:26:08,640
Even for a moment, it's worth it.

472
00:26:37,190 --> 00:26:38,360
Wang Lin...

473
00:26:38,870 --> 00:26:40,280
Next time,

474
00:26:40,510 --> 00:26:41,880
you definitely

475
00:26:42,630 --> 00:26:45,400
won't escape my grasp !
